{"title":{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"端口管理"}]},"ast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"admonition","keyword":"caution","title":[],"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"本文未完成，长期更新中..."}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"端口和进程"}],"identifier":"heading-端口和进程"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"marker":42,"spread":true,"children":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"列出所有进程 id 和端口信息"}]},{"type":"code","lang":"bash","meta":null,"value":"$ sudo netstat -ntlp\n"}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"杀死占用了指定端口的进程"}]},{"type":"code","lang":"bash","meta":null,"value":"$ sudo netstat -nltp\\\n  | grep ':1001\\|:1002'\\\n  | awk '{print $7}'\\\n  | grep -o '^[0-9]\\+'\\\n  | sort\\\n  | uniq\\\n  | xargs kill -9\n"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"其中："}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"marker":45,"spread":false,"children":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"sudo netstat -nltp"},{"type":"text","value":": 列出所有进程 id 和端口信息（如果不使用 "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"root"},{"type":"text","value":" 权限，有些进程 id 不会显示）"}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"grep ':1001\\|:1002"},{"type":"text","value":": 过滤出使用了端口号 1001 或 1002 的进程"}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"awk '{print $7}'"},{"type":"text","value":": 只打印记录了进程 id 的那一列数据"}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"grep -o '^[0-9]\\+'"},{"type":"text","value":": 过滤出进程 id"}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"sort | uniq"},{"type":"text","value":": 去重"}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"xargs kill -9"},{"type":"text","value":": 杀死进程"}]}]},{"type":"admonition","keyword":"tip","title":[],"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"末尾的反斜杠指示解释器命令未结束，需连结下一行内容一起解析；若反斜杠后面跟随了任意字符（包括空格），则它会被解析成“对反斜杠右侧的字符进行转义”。"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"根据指定端口，查看进程 id（如果不使用 "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"root"},{"type":"text","value":" 权限，有些进程 id 不会显示）"}]},{"type":"code","lang":"bash","meta":null,"value":"$ sudo lsof -i:8080\n"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"反向隧道"}],"identifier":"heading-反向隧道"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"反向隧道用于在外网中访问内网的机器的 SOCKET 地址，也可以是在虚拟机中访问本机的回环地址上的端口。隧道的本质是一个数据转发通道，通道两侧的入口/出口分别位于本机和远程服务器中，则远程服务器向自己的某个端口（隧道的一侧）发送数据，这份数据会直接转发到本机的端口（隧道的另一侧），以此实现内网穿透。"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"marker":42,"spread":true,"children":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"SSH 反向隧道"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"创建一个从本机 "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"127.0.0.1:3000"},{"type":"text","value":" 到远程服务器 "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"3000"},{"type":"text","value":" 端口的隧道，则在远程服务器中可以直接访问 "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"127.0.0.1:3000"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"code","lang":"bash","meta":null,"value":"$ ssh remote-machine -Nf -R :3000:127.0.0.1:3000\n"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"也可以指定远程服务器所绑定的某个具体的 ip 地址："}]},{"type":"code","lang":"bash","meta":null,"value":"$ ssh remote-machine -Nf -R 192.168.0.1:3000:127.0.0.1:3000\n"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"端口转发"}],"identifier":"heading-端口转发"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"marker":42,"spread":true,"children":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"监听本机所有地址上的 "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"5050"},{"type":"text","value":" 端口，并将其上面的所有请求都转发到 "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"127.0.0.1:8080"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（实现类似跳板机的效果）"}]},{"type":"code","lang":null,"meta":null,"value":"$ socat tcp-l:5050,fork,reuseaddr tcp:127.0.0.1:8080 \n"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Related"}],"identifier":"heading-related"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"marker":42,"spread":false,"children":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://qastack.cn/unix/293304/using-netcat-for-port-forwarding","children":[{"type":"text","value":"使用netcat进行端口转发"}]}]}]}]},"frontmatter":{"title":"端口管理","createdAt":"2021-06-20T09:49:08.000Z","updatedAt":"2021-11-03T05:57:24.000Z","tags":["network","port","ssh","netstat"]},"definitionMap":{},"footnoteDefinitionMap":{},"ecmaImports":[],"images":[],"toc":{"children":[{"depth":2,"identifier":"heading-端口和进程","contents":[{"type":"text","value":"端口和进程"}],"children":[]},{"depth":2,"identifier":"heading-反向隧道","contents":[{"type":"text","value":"反向隧道"}],"children":[]},{"depth":2,"identifier":"heading-端口转发","contents":[{"type":"text","value":"端口转发"}],"children":[]},{"depth":2,"identifier":"heading-related","contents":[{"type":"text","value":"Related"}],"children":[]}]},"excerpt":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"admonition","keyword":"caution","title":[],"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"本文未完成，长期更新中..."}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"端口和进程"}],"identifier":"heading-端口和进程"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"marker":42,"spread":true,"children":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"列出所有进程 id 和端口信息"}]},{"type":"code","lang":"bash","meta":null,"value":"$ sudo netstat -ntlp\n"}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"杀死占用了指定端口的进程"}]},{"type":"code","lang":"bash","meta":null,"value":"$ sudo netstat -nltp\\\n  | grep ':1001\\|:1002'\\\n  | awk '{print $7}'\\\n  | grep -o '^[0-9]\\+'\\\n  | sort\\\n  | uniq\\\n  | xargs kill -9\n"}]}]}]},"timeToRead":209}